  follow-up                                   alone  joined  condensed
  Which region was that account in?              no     yes        yes
  And how full was it at year end?              yes     yes        yes
  Which line was short?                         yes     yes        yes
  What revision is it at?                        no     yes        yes
  And what was the notice about the depot?      yes     yes        yes
  And before a price rise?                      yes      no        yes

  right chunk in the top 6: follow-up alone 4/6, previous + follow-up 5/6, condensed 6/6

  e.g. 'And how full was it at year end?' -> 'How full was the racked storage at the Dallas depot at year end?'
